16 / 18 identical. The two divergent cells are BOTH screen-content-classified
images at preset 2 (IntraBC + palette live: the port's
`intrabc::full_pixel_search` is 12.8 % of its Ir on screen_terminal p2; at p6
and p10 the same crops are identical). This is a CORRECTNESS finding for the
screen-content lane, not a count: the tools/screen_ibc_gate.sh grid is
presets 0-4 x qp {20, 48} on these images, so qp 40 at p2 is not a cell any
existing gate runs. Counts for those two cells are in the TSV, flagged
